{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1107937-bloodline-the-dunia-akhud","id":1107937,"title":"[Bloodline] The Dunia (Akhud)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-26T01:20:00-07:00","id":1107937,"title":"[Bloodline] The Dunia (Akhud)","content":"With the release of <b>A Thousand Years of Night</b>, we finally have Second Edition rules for the murderous and mysterious Clan Akhud, formerly of <b>VII</b>. In that particular sourcebook, it mentions there are three bloodlines of Ahranites (the Rexroths, the Dunia, and Stawa), but these were never written up beyond a subsection of the Akhud clan spread.<br /> <br /> Long story short, I got a little bored today, and this was the result. The Dunia had the most compelling soundbite, so they were the ones I chose. Work in progress, so comments are welcome:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_E3WNZf5G35RGVnTGlxbktBTzA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_E...ew?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> I repurposed the Shaddad mythos a bit, because it felt more like a bloodline thing now that it's not part of (so far) the clan in Second Edition. I'm not sure if the Merit ought to be Devotions instead, but we've had a lot of Khaibit-like bloodlines, and I wanted to do something different. Also, I find it easier to write Merits...<br /> <br /> I feel like their niche has kind of been done with previous bloodline powers (Tenure comes to mind), but I tried to make it more about scouting and spying and searching rather than personal territory.<br /> <br /> Enjoy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T14:41:02-07:00","id":1108148,"title":"","content":"I'd allow them to sleep in the ground the hard way (without Unmarked Grave just using a spade) just so it's not 100% dependant on having the discipline and remember that harder ground costs Vitie to rest in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T15:41:57-07:00","id":1108171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1107937-bloodline-the-dunia-akhud?p=1108148#post1108148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd allow them to sleep in the ground the hard way (without Unmarked Grave just using a spade) just so it's not 100% dependant on having the discipline and remember that harder ground costs Vitie to rest in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I think there should be some way of them doing it without Protean 1, I'm just not sure what. On the other hand, most of the attraction of playing them is getting access to Protean, and their Merit is keyed off it, so it might be okay as is? I *do* want it to cost more and more Vitae though; that's by design.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian",